---
interface Props { heading?: string | null; }
const { heading = 'Fogged glass: find the moisture in the depth.' } = Astro.props;
---
<figure class="glass-explainer">
  {heading && <figcaption class="heading">{heading}</figcaption>}
  <p class="intro">The useful question is not “does the glass look foggy?” It is <strong>where the moisture is sitting</strong>.</p>

  <div class="cases">
    <article class="case failed">
      <header><span class="case-badge">A</span><div><p>SEALED-UNIT FAILURE</p><h3>Moisture is between the panes</h3></div></header>
      <div class="section" role="img" aria-label="Side section of an insulated glass unit showing moisture trapped in the sealed cavity between the outside and inside panes.">
        <div class="zone outside">OUTSIDE</div>
        <div class="zone inside">ROOM</div>
        <div class="pane pane-outer"></div>
        <div class="cavity cavity-failed"><span class="fog-dot d1"></span><span class="fog-dot d2"></span><span class="fog-dot d3"></span><span class="fog-dot d4"></span></div>
        <div class="pane pane-inner"></div>
        <div class="spacer spacer-top"></div><div class="spacer spacer-bottom"></div>
        <div class="moisture-callout"><span class="line"></span><strong>MOISTURE</strong><small>inside the sealed gap</small></div>
        <div class="seal-callout"><span class="line"></span><strong>SEAL</strong><small>no longer protecting cavity</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="answer"><strong>What it means:</strong> the insulating glass unit has lost its seal. Wiping the room-side surface will not remove moisture trapped between the panes.</div>
    </article>

    <article class="case surface">
      <header><span class="case-badge">B</span><div><p>SURFACE CONDENSATION</p><h3>Water is on the room-side glass surface</h3></div></header>
      <div class="section" role="img" aria-label="Side section of a sound insulated glass unit showing clear space between the panes and water droplets on the room-facing surface of the inside pane.">
        <div class="zone outside">OUTSIDE</div>
        <div class="zone inside">ROOM</div>
        <div class="pane pane-outer"></div>
        <div class="cavity cavity-good"></div>
        <div class="pane pane-inner"></div>
        <div class="spacer spacer-top"></div><div class="spacer spacer-bottom"></div>
        <div class="surface-drops"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="moisture-callout"><span class="line"></span><strong>WATER</strong><small>on the room-side surface</small></div>
        <div class="seal-callout"><span class="line"></span><strong>SEALED GAP</strong><small>still clear / intact</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="answer"><strong>What it means:</strong> the moisture is outside the sealed unit. Humidity and surface temperature affect how much condensation forms.</div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="test"><span>QUICK TEST</span><strong>Wipe the room side.</strong><span>Clear after wiping → surface condensation.</span><span>Still hazy between panes → failed insulated glass.</span></div>
</figure>

<style>
.glass-explainer{margin:0}.heading{display:block;margin:0 0 .35rem;font-size:var(--step-2);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-display)}.intro{margin:0 0 var(--space-l);max-width:68ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:var(--step--1)}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:var(--space-l)}.case{padding:var(--space-m);border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:4px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-lg)}.failed{border-top-color:var(--danger)}.surface{border-top-color:var(--accent)}.case header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:var(--space-s);align-items:center;margin-bottom:var(--space-s)}.case-badge{display:grid;width:2.8rem;height:2.8rem;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-size:var(--step-0);font-weight:750}.failed .case-badge{background:var(--danger)}.surface .case-badge{background:var(--accent)}.case header p{margin:0 0 .15rem;font-size:var(--step--2);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);color:var(--ink-faint)}.case h3{margin:0;max-width:28ch;font-size:var(--step-1);line-height:1.12}
.section{position:relative;min-height:25rem;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 5%,transparent),var(--paper-sunk) 18%,var(--paper-sunk) 82%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 7%,transparent))}.zone{position:absolute;top:1rem;font-size:10px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--ink-faint)}.outside{left:1rem}.inside{right:1rem}.pane{position:absolute;top:4.5rem;bottom:3rem;width:1.25rem;border:2px solid var(--ink)}.pane-outer{left:22%;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent-2) 23%,transparent)}.pane-inner{right:22%;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 18%,transparent)}.cavity{position:absolute;top:5rem;bottom:3.5rem;left:calc(22% + 1.25rem);right:calc(22% + 1.25rem);border-top:3px solid var(--accent);border-bottom:3px solid var(--accent)}.cavity-failed{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--danger) 8%,transparent);border-color:var(--danger)}.cavity-good{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 5%,transparent)}.spacer{position:absolute;left:calc(22% + 1.25rem);right:calc(22% + 1.25rem);height:1rem;background:var(--paper-raised);border:2px solid var(--line-strong)}.spacer-top{top:4.35rem}.spacer-bottom{bottom:2.85rem}.fog-dot{position:absolute;display:block;border-radius:50%;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--danger) 42%,transparent)}.d1{width:2rem;height:2rem;left:18%;top:25%}.d2{width:3rem;height:3rem;left:43%;top:48%}.d3{width:1.6rem;height:1.6rem;left:62%;top:28%}.d4{width:2.4rem;height:2.4rem;left:70%;top:61%}.surface-drops span{position:absolute;right:calc(22% - 1.25rem);display:block;background:var(--accent-ink);border-radius:50%;transform:translateX(50%)}.surface-drops span:nth-child(1){top:28%;width:1rem;height:1rem}.surface-drops span:nth-child(2){top:39%;width:1.5rem;height:1.5rem}.surface-drops span:nth-child(3){top:51%;width:.8rem;height:.8rem}.surface-drops span:nth-child(4){top:61%;width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem}.surface-drops span:nth-child(5){top:71%;width:.7rem;height:.7rem}.moisture-callout,.seal-callout{position:absolute;display:grid;gap:.15rem;min-width:8rem}.moisture-callout{left:50%;top:16%;transform:translateX(-50%);text-align:center}.seal-callout{left:50%;bottom:6%;transform:translateX(-50%);text-align:center}.moisture-callout .line{display:block;width:1px;height:2rem;margin:0 auto;background:var(--danger)}.seal-callout .line{display:block;width:1px;height:1.5rem;margin:0 auto;background:var(--accent)}.moisture-callout strong,.seal-callout strong{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em}.failed .moisture-callout strong{color:var(--danger)}.surface .moisture-callout strong{color:var(--accent-ink)}.seal-callout strong{color:var(--ink-faint)}.moisture-callout small,.seal-callout small{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-soft)}.answer{margin-top:var(--space-s);padding:.85rem .95rem;background:var(--paper-sunk);border-left:3px solid var(--ink);color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:var(--step--1)}.failed .answer{border-left-color:var(--danger)}.surface .answer{border-left-color:var(--accent)}.answer strong{color:var(--ink)}.test{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.45rem var(--space-s);margin-top:var(--space-l);padding:var(--space-s) var(--space-m);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper-raised);font-size:var(--step--1);color:var(--ink-soft)}.test>span:first-child{font-size:var(--step--2);font-weight:750;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);color:var(--ink)}.test strong{color:var(--ink)}
@media(max-width:900px){.cases{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.section{min-height:20rem}.pane-outer{left:16%}.pane-inner{right:16%}.cavity,.spacer{left:calc(16% + 1.25rem);right:calc(16% + 1.25rem)}.surface-drops span{right:calc(16% - 1.25rem)}}
</style>
